From a66896b8e563eb748a7d991e5d0ba00b89bca42c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dsh-wake <wake@local>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:36:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(voice): stop wiping the stream on noise; the wake word
 was in it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Decoding the same 20 s sample offline with the same model and the same 5x gain
gives 小安小安 at 19 s — so the audio, the model and the gain are right, and the
only thing between them and a match was this path's own stream handling.

A text that is one syllable repeated used to reset the stream. On a noisy room
that reset fires about once a second, so the half-second a person spends saying
小安 is wiped before the model can finish it. 小安语音助手 resets only on a pause,
and the pause it waits for is 1500 ms, not 700.
---
 .../ccch1mneyyy/dsh_app/wake/WakeCapture.kt   |  46 ++++--
 app/lib/ui/settings/voice_settings_page.dart  |  24 ++--
 app/lib/voice/wake_word.dart                  | 133 ++++++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 159 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/github/ccch1mneyyy/dsh_app/wake/WakeCapture.kt b/app/android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/github/ccch1mneyyy/dsh_app/wake/WakeCapture.kt
